##################################################################
#   OpenJVS: 3AGAME 3A-3H Retro Shooter - Player 1 (Joystick mode) *
#   ---------+--------------------+----------------
#   Version  |    Date            | Description
#   ---------+--------------------+----------------
#     0.1    | 7th of June 2026   | initial version
#   ---------+--------------------+----------------
#
# Supported events:
# -----------------
# pointer:                                type 3 (EV_ABS), code 0   (ABS_X) + code 1 (ABS_Y)
# trigger:                                type 1 (EV_KEY), code 288 (BTN_TRIGGER), value 1
# little rounded button (near trigger):   type 1 (EV_KEY), code 289 (BTN_THUMB),   value 1 **
# bottom button (bottom of the magazine): type 1 (EV_KEY), code 291 (BTN_TOP),     value 1 **
# first button (near lens):               type 1 (EV_KEY), code 290 (BTN_THUMB2),  value 1 
# second button (near lens):              type 1 (EV_KEY), code 293 (BTN_PINKIE),  value 1
# Pedal:                                  type 1 (EV_KEY), code 289 (BTN_THUMB),   value 1 
# Joystick:
#  - UP:     type 3 (EV_ABS), code 17 (ABS_HAT0Y), value -1
#  - DOWN:   type 3 (EV_ABS), code 17 (ABS_HAT0Y), value  1
#  - LEFT:   type 3 (EV_ABS), code 16 (ABS_HAT0X), value -1
#  - RIGHT:  type 3 (EV_ABS), code 16 (ABS_HAT0X), value  1
#  - BUTTON: type 1 (EV_KEY), code 292 (BTN_TOP2), value  1  
#
# Additional information
# ----------------------
# * Set gun in joystick mode:
#   When you plug the USB cable into the PC or Raspberry PI, etc., 
#   it will recognize three devices: mouse/keyboard/game controller, 
#   but these three devices are not input devices at the same time. 
#   -> The default is mouse + keyboard input. 
#   -> PLEASE SWITCH IT TO GAME CONTROLLER INPUT FIRST.
# 
#   Switching operation:
#   Press and hold start button (first button near lens), then move joystick to the right and wait for 3 seconds,
#   then LED3 lights up yellow, the light gun successfully switches to game controller input to PC.
# 
# ** Set little button and Button at bottom of magazine:
#    The small button on the handle and the big button at the bottom of the magazine can be switched as the BTN_THUMB & BTN_TOP. 
#    => following configuration asumes you are using button at bottom of magazine for for reload (set as BTN_TOP)    
#    => for games that need pedal, this one is mapped to CONTROLLER_BUTTON_D by now.
#
#    Switching operation:
#    press and hold the big button at the bottom of the magazine, then plug in the USB cable, wait 5 seconds and release it.
#    Just press and hold the small button, then plug in the USB cable, wait 5 seconds and release it, the small button will become the reload button again. 
#
# External references: 
# https://retroshooter.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Retro-Shooter-User-Manual-2025.pdf
# 
##################################################################

ABS_X CONTROLLER_ANALOGUE_X
ABS_Y CONTROLLER_ANALOGUE_Y

BTN_TRIGGER CONTROLLER_BUTTON_A

BTN_TOP CONTROLLER_BUTTON_C

BTN_THUMB2 CONTROLLER_BUTTON_START

# Let's use button at bottom of magazine for reload
BTN_TOP CONTROLLER_BUTTON_B

# pedal or little button
BTN_THUMB CONTROLLER_BUTTON_D

ABS_HAT0Y CONTROLLER_BUTTON_UP CONTROLLER_BUTTON_DOWN

BTN_TOP2 CONTROLLER_BUTTON_COIN CONTROLLER_1
